---
// Wraps every section that shows the site grid (everything after the hero). It draws the two vertical rules ONCE,
// as a decoration over the whole stack (`.page-grid::before` in styles/global.css), so they run unbroken from
// the first section to the footer, and sections only add their own full-bleed horizontal rules (see Section.astro).
---

<div class="page-grid gap-30 mt-30 relative">
  <slot />
</div>
